---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Principal machine learning engineer</p>

  <h1 id="intro-heading">
    Building useful systems for complex problems.
    <span class="wave" aria-hidden="true">
      👋
    </span>
  </h1>

  <p class="hero-intro">
    Hi, I’m Ciarán. I build machine learning systems and explore practical
    applications of emerging technologies.
  </p>

  <p class="pronunciation">Ciarán is pronounced “KEER-awn”</p>

  <div
    class="page-actions home-actions"
    aria-label="Site links and contact links"
  >
    <a class="icon-button icon-button--resume" href="/resume/">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8zm0 1.5L19.5 9H14zM8 13h8v1.5H8zm0 3h8v1.5H8zm0-6h4v1.5H8z"></path>
