  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Areas of focus</p>
    <h2 id="focus-heading">Where I spend my time</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="focus-grid">
    <article class="focus-card">
      <h3>Machine learning systems</h3>
      <p>Turning models and research into reliable, useful products.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="focus-card">
      <h3>Applied AI</h3>
      <p>Exploring practical applications of emerging technologies.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="focus-card">
      <h3>Product engineering</h3>
      <p>Connecting technical ideas to clear and thoughtful experiences.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
